--- !u!114 &5915978795506360365
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 647670522733538556}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: acc9ca5f5359d33458dfaac8dc7efcb2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MapInteractable
  map: {fileID: 0}
  displayName: Seth
  description: What's up?
  token1: In the afternoon, I saw Thoth carrying a bunch of books home. I have no
    idea why he needs all that stuff.
  token2: Today morning, I was hanging out in the square and I heard Osiris talking
    about his collection again.
  token3: In the evening, I helped out Thoth with moving some books around the Library.
  token4: I was at the doctor Anubis this morning. He prescribed some expensive herbs
    for me.
  tokenPair1And2: On the square, Osiris was singing and chanting about his new shiny
    Skull trophy.
  tokenPair1And3: While I was helping Thoth out with some books, all I saw were dusty
    shelves and boxes, nothing weird.
  tokenPair1And4: I was told about the loss, but I wasn't there to see it myself.
  tokenPair2And3: While I was busy with the books, all I could hear was Thoth muttering
    to himself.
  tokenPair2And4: I heard about the theft after everyone started talking about it.
  tokenPair3And4: When I found out about the theft, I just decided to let it be.
    Who am I to interfere?
  journalId: seth
  journalTitle: Seth
  journalDescription: He looks unhealthy.
  journalToken1Body: 
  journalToken2Body: 
  journalToken3Body: Was helping Thoth with his books.
  journalToken4Body: Was prescribed expensive herbs
  journalPair1And2Body: 
  journalPair1And3Body: 
  journalPair1And4Body: Never witnessed the theft.
  journalPair2And3Body: 
  journalPair2And4Body: Was unawair of the theft.
  journalPair3And4Body: 
