--- !u!114 &5042761812274895213
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 808386799584021873}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: acc9ca5f5359d33458dfaac8dc7efcb2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MapInteractable
  map: {fileID: 0}
  displayName: Anubis
  description: How can I assist you?
  token1: When me and Osiris finished with chess, I took a look at the clock and
    it was 19:30.
  token2: I might've heard something creaking behind the wall during our game.
  token3: In the evening, I was playing chess with Osiris in his office.
  token4: Thoth asked me for some help with his books, but I already had plans with
    Osiris for the game.
  tokenPair1And2: When I heard a loud screeching noise coming from behind the door,
    I checked my watch. It was around 19:00.
  tokenPair1And3: While I was playing, all I could see was Osiris and the chessboard.
    We were at it for about an hour.
  tokenPair1And4: Osiris said the Skull was missing and when I went to the showroom,
    the pedestal was indeed empty.
  tokenPair2And3: When I heard the noise, I just kept playing. I thought Horus might
    be moving the furniture or something.
  tokenPair2And4: Osiris said Horus was going to clean the showroom, so I wasn't
    really paying attention to the noises.
  tokenPair3And4: Osiris invited me over for some chess in the evening. I got there
    at 18:30 and we finished up an hour later.
  journalId: anubis
  journalTitle: Anubis
  journalDescription: He's a doctor.
  journalToken1Body: Chess match ended at 19:30.
  journalToken2Body: 
  journalToken3Body: 
  journalToken4Body: Couldn't help Thoth with the books.
  journalPair1And2Body: Noises from the showroom started right in the middle of the
    chess match.
  journalPair1And3Body: 
  journalPair1And4Body: 
  journalPair2And3Body: 
  journalPair2And4Body: 
  journalPair3And4Body: 
