--- !u!114 &2776178406532396867
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1476931192328101705}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: acc9ca5f5359d33458dfaac8dc7efcb2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MapInteractable
  map: {fileID: 0}
  displayName: Thoth
  description: What can I help with?
  token1: From the Library window, one can catch a glimpse of a portion of the museum
    and the pathway near it.
  token2: There are no sounds coming from the museum to the Library.
  token3: That day, I was engaged in the task of categorizing books and creating
    space on the bookshelves.
  token4: The museum has borrowed a sizable wooden cleaning crate from me.
  tokenPair1And2: In the stillness of the night, I could only see Seth wandering
    around on the street.
  tokenPair1And3: In the morning, I delivered the box to the door of the Library.
    Later, as I peered out, I saw Horus carrying it away.
  tokenPair1And4: Horus requested a cleaning crate from me. Later, I noticed Seth
    at the back door of the museum, which is where my crate was later found.
  tokenPair2And3: When I was busy with the books, I only could hear the creaking
    of ancient holdings of knowledge.
  tokenPair2And4: Horus was preoccupied with the crate. He made some remark regarding
    his hasty boss.
  tokenPair3And4: I sought the assistance of Anubis in sorting the books, but alas,
    he was busy. Consequently, I was left to tackle the task myself for the entire
    evening.
  journalId: thoth
  journalTitle: Thoth
  journalDescription: He's a librarian.
  journalToken1Body: 
  journalToken2Body: 
  journalToken3Body: 
  journalToken4Body: 
  journalPair1And2Body: 
  journalPair1And3Body: Lent a large crate to Horus.
  journalPair1And4Body: Saw Seth near the location of borrowed crate.
  journalPair2And3Body: 
  journalPair2And4Body: 
  journalPair3And4Body: Was working alone in the library in the evening.
