--- !u!114 &1443764027375237223
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1983745276016641994}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: acc9ca5f5359d33458dfaac8dc7efcb2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MapInteractable
  map: {fileID: 0}
  displayName: Osiris
  description: Yes?
  token1: Before the game, the Skull was on a stand. When we came back, it was gone.
  token2: I usually don't hear a lot from the office. The walls in here are pretty
    thick.
  token3: I played some chess with Anubis in the evening and after that I was about
    to to close the museum.
  token4: Horus told me that the clean-up would be done before the museum closed.
  tokenPair1And2: When we got back to the showroom, there was an empty stand and
    a soft wind whistling.
  tokenPair1And3: Before the game, I checked out the showroom. I saw that everything
    was in place. Horus usually takes care of the cleaning and moving of museum stuff.
  tokenPair1And4: Horus told me that "everything was cool", but when I got back,
    the Skull went missing.
  tokenPair2And3: While I was playing with Anubis, I didn't hear anything unusual.
  tokenPair2And4: Anubis thought he heard something outside the door, but I couldn't
    hear anything.
  tokenPair3And4: I suggested we chess some more, but then Anubis reminded me it
    was time to close the museum.
  journalId: osiris
  journalTitle: Osiris
  journalDescription: He's a museum director.
  journalToken1Body: The Skull dissapeared during the game of chess with Anubis.
  journalToken2Body: 
  journalToken3Body: 
  journalToken4Body: 
  journalPair1And2Body: 
  journalPair1And3Body: Horus is responsible for cleaning the showroom.
  journalPair1And4Body: 
  journalPair2And3Body: 
  journalPair2And4Body: 
  journalPair3And4Body: 
