--- !u!114 &9202897306282226977
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2231912205069014132}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: acc9ca5f5359d33458dfaac8dc7efcb2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MapInteractable
  map: {fileID: 0}
  displayName: Horus
  description: Reporting for duty.
  token1: At 18:30, I saw my boss and a guest walk into the office.
  token2: The only thing you can hear in the museum is the floorboards creaking day
    and night.
  token3: In the evening, I was giving the showroom a clean.
  token4: My boss told me to clean up the showroom before we closed.
  tokenPair1And2: I saw my boss leaving with a guest in their office. I could only
    hear them having a little chat.
  tokenPair1And3: When I was cleaning the showroom, I there was no one left except
    my boss's guest. I didn't go anywhere myself.
  tokenPair1And4: My boss said he'd be busy playing. I saw the guest holding a chessboard.
  tokenPair2And3: I didn't hear anything special during the cleaning.
  tokenPair2And4: No one told me about any weird noises.
  tokenPair3And4: My boss asked me to clean the room, which I had been busy with
    all evening.
  journalId: horus
  journalTitle: Horus
  journalDescription: He's a museum caretaker.
  journalToken1Body: At 18:30 his boss had a visitor.
  journalToken2Body: 
  journalToken3Body: Is responsible for cleaning the showroom.
  journalToken4Body: 
  journalPair1And2Body: 
  journalPair1And3Body: Was the last remaining in the showroom.
  journalPair1And4Body: 
  journalPair2And3Body: 
  journalPair2And4Body: 
  journalPair3And4Body: 
